# Marker file for PEP 561.
#
# Its presence tells type checkers (Pylance/Pyright, mypy) that
# ``xyberos_documents`` ships inline type annotations and must be analyzed as a
# typed package. Without it, strict mode reports:
#
#     Stub file not found for "xyberos_documents" (reportMissingTypeStubs)
#
# Keep this file beside the package's ``__init__.py`` (PEP 561). Setuptools'
# default package-data handling already ships it in wheels and sdists;
# ``pyproject.toml`` also declares it explicitly to keep the intent obvious.
